      "content": [
        {
          "renderType": "richText",
          "tag": "h2",
          "content": "What is Maple?"
        },
        {
          "renderType": "richText",
          "tag": "p",
          "content": "Maple is a virtual healthcare platform founded in 2015. It offers direct access to doctors and nurse practitioners, 24/7 from your smartphone, tablet, or computer. Maple can be accessed privately as an individual, through employer benefits or insurers or publicly through select provincial health systems. To date, over 3 million consults have been completed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "renderType": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "paddingTop": "l",
      "paddingTopLarge": "2xl",
      "content": [
        {
          "renderType": "container",
          "maxWidth": "xs",
          "richTextStyles": true,
          "content": [
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h2",
              "content": "The Project"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "Migrate the existing monolithic WordPress site to a static site build on Cloudflare Workers using headless WordPress on AWS Lightsail."
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h3",
              "content": "The Brief"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h4",
              "content": "Context"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "An audit of the top 20 pages by traffic revealed significant performance, UX, accessibility and brand-consistency problems across the marketing site: "
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "ul",
              "content": [
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Outdated platform: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "WordPress ran as a multisite install on an outdated core, theme and PHP version, with over 44 active plugins."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Expensive hosting: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "Pantheon's plan ran around $1k a month and was difficult to optimize. Pushing a single change per environment took over ten minutes, in addition to persistent caching issues."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Buggy page builder: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "Beaver Builder was slow and tedious to edit, requiring manually recreating pages across environments to share previews with stakeholders and introduced inconsistencies with custom CSS/JS per page."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Client-side geotargeting: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "GeoTargetingWP swapped page content entirely client-side, causing layout shifts and loading overhead."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Unreliable scheduling: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "WordPress's built-in scheduler wasn't a real cron job, so scheduled pages often failed to publish on time."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "A11Y issues: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "Interactive components were missing state feedback and proper focus management."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
