            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "renderType": "container",
          "maxWidth": "xs",
          "richTextStyles": true,
          "content": [
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h3",
              "content": "Headless WordPress"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "Sticking with WordPress instead of switching to another headless CMS came down to practical factors. AWS was already used elsewhere at Maple. It also meant owning our own data and having the option to sit behind SSO without extra cost. Staying on the same CMS also simplified the migration and shortened the learning curve for the team."
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "ul",
              "content": [
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Shareable previews: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "Live preview links and copyable/syncable patterns replaced manually recreating pages across environments to share with the team."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Faster workflows: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "Production data can be selectively pulled into local and staging environments to keep them in sync, and bulk changes are easier with WP CLI and Gutenberg blocks instead of Beaver Builder's serialized data."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Reliable scheduling: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "A real server-level cron job replaced WordPress's traffic-triggered scheduler, so entries publish on time."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Editable forms: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "Forms moved from Gravity Forms to Formstack, allowing the business development team to update them on their own."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
